#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:534
msgid ""
"Enter payment information for customers (for example, payment methods "
"accepted at the store and receipts)."
msgstr ""
"お支払いに関する案内（ご来店時に使える支払い方法、領収書の発行など）を入力し"
"ます。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:535
msgid ""
"This is shown in the \"Payment method\" section of the booking confirmation "
"screen."
msgstr "予約確認画面の「決済方法」欄に表示されます。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:540
msgid ""
"Because card payment is enabled, this text is shown to customers regardless "
"of which payment method they choose."
msgstr ""
"カード決済を有効にしているため、この案内はどちらの決済方法を選んだお客様にも"
"表示されます。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:541
msgid ""
"If some information applies only to payment at the store, make that clear, "
"for example by starting with \"For payment at the store, ...\"."
msgstr ""
"来店時の支払いだけに当てはまる内容は「ご来店時のお支払いには〜」のように、対"
"象がわかるように書いてください。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:564
msgid ""
"Card payment is enabled, but \"Payment instructions\" still contains the "
"default text written for paying at the store."
msgstr ""
"カード決済を有効にしていますが、「お支払いの案内」が来店時払い向けの初期設定"
"の文章のままです。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:565
msgid ""
"This text is also shown to customers who choose card payment, so please "
"revise it to fit both payment methods."
msgstr ""
"この案内はカード決済を選んだお客様にも表示されるため、どちらの支払い方法にも"
"当てはまる内容に見直してください。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:572
msgid "Edit payment instructions"
msgstr "お支払いの案内を編集する"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:586
msgid "This is still the default text written for paying at the store."
msgstr "この文章は来店時払い向けの初期設定のままです。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:587
msgid ""
"It is also shown to customers who choose card payment, so please revise it."
msgstr "カード決済を選んだお客様にも表示されるため、見直してください。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:628
msgid "Currently, the reservation acceptance method is \"Guests only\"."
msgstr "現在、予約の受付方法は「ゲストのみ」です。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:629
msgid ""
"The login and user registration fields are not shown on the reservation "
"screen."
msgstr "予約画面にログインとユーザー登録の欄は表示されません。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:635
msgid "Currently, the reservation acceptance method is \"Members or guests\"."
msgstr "現在、予約の受付方法は「会員・ゲストのどちらでも」です。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:636
msgid ""
"The settings on this tab apply only to customers who make reservations as "
"members."
msgstr "このタブの設定は、会員として予約するお客様にだけ適用されます。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:651
msgid "The sender email address is not set."
msgstr "送信元メールアドレスが未設定です。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:652
msgid ""
"Confirmation emails for guest reservations may be treated as spam and not "
"reach customers."
msgstr ""
"ゲスト予約の確認メールが迷惑メールと判断され、お客様に届かないおそれがありま"
"す。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:653
msgid "Please set a sender email address on your own domain."
msgstr "お使いのドメインの送信元メールアドレスを設定してください。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:655
msgid "Open the email settings"
msgstr "メール設定を開く"

#. translators: %d: Maximum allowed value in pixels.
#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:709
msgid ""
"The \"Base corner radius\" was set to a value larger than the current "
"maximum and has been adjusted to %dpx. Save the settings to persist this "
"value."
msgstr ""
"「角丸の基本サイズ」が現在の上限を超える値になっていたため、%dpx に調整してい"
"ます。この調整を保持するには設定を保存してください。"

