"During the service time plus the buffer time, new reservations will not be "
"accepted."
msgstr "サービス時間＋バッファ時間の間は新規予約を受け付けません。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1887
#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1909
#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1932
msgid "If there is an input for each service menu, that will take priority."
msgstr "各サービスメニューで入力がある場合はそちらが優先されます。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1896
#: src/admin/class-service-menu-editor.php:548
#: src/post-types/class-service-menu-post-type.php:434
#: src/post-types/class-service-menu-post-type.php:894
msgid "Reservation deadline"
msgstr "予約締切"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1907
#: src/admin/class-service-menu-editor.php:551
#: src/post-types/class-service-menu-post-type.php:896
msgid "hours ago"
msgstr "時間前"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1916
#: src/admin/class-service-menu-editor.php:570
msgid "Max advance booking period"
msgstr "予約可能な最大日数"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1927
#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:3436
#: src/admin/class-service-menu-editor.php:573
msgid "days"
msgstr "日"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1929
#: src/admin/class-service-menu-editor.php:575
msgid ""
"The maximum number of days in advance that reservations can be made. Set to "
"0 for no limit."
msgstr ""
"本日から何日先までの予約を受付可能かを指定する事ができます。0の場合は無制限"
"（シフト登録のある日時）となります。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1939
msgid "Maximum upcoming reservations per customer"
msgstr "お客様1人あたりの予約数の上限"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1950
msgctxt "unit of reservation count"
msgid "reservations"
msgstr "件"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1952
msgid ""
"The number of upcoming reservations a single customer can hold at the same "
"time."
msgstr "お客様1人が同時に入れておける、これから先の予約の数です。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1953
msgid ""
"A customer who has reached the limit cannot make a new reservation until one "
"of their reservations ends or is cancelled."
msgstr ""
"上限に達したお客様は、予約が終わるかキャンセルするまで新しい予約ができませ"
"ん。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1954
msgid "Set to 0 for no limit."
msgstr "0 にすると上限なしになります。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1957
msgid ""
"Reservations whose date and time have passed, cancelled reservations, and no-"
"show reservations are not counted."
msgstr "日時が過ぎた予約・キャンセル済み・無断キャンセルの予約は数えません。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1958
msgid "A reservation for multiple people or multiple nights counts as one."
msgstr "複数人分や連泊の予約も1件と数えます。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1961
msgid "Pending reservations are also counted."
msgstr "承認待ちの予約も数えます。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1962
msgid ""
"Reservations that the store makes on behalf of customers are not stopped by "
"this limit."
msgstr "店舗が代理で入れる予約は上限で止めません。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1969
msgid "Reservation acceptance method"
msgstr "予約の受付方法"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1977
msgid "Members only (only logged-in customers can make reservations)"
msgstr "会員のみ（ログインしたお客様だけが予約できます）"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1980
msgid ""
"Guests only (customers can make reservations without registering as a user)"
msgstr "ゲストのみ（ユーザー登録なしで予約できます）"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1983
msgid "Members or guests (customers choose on the reservation screen)"
msgstr "会員・ゲストのどちらでも（お客様が予約画面で選びます）"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1987
msgid ""
"Choose whether customers can make reservations without registering as a user."
msgstr "ユーザー登録なしで予約できるようにするかを選びます。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1990
msgid ""
"A guest reservation is accepted when the customer opens the link in the "
"confirmation email."
msgstr "ゲストの予約は、お客様が確認メールのリンクを開いた時点で受け付けます。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1991
msgid ""
"If \"Reservation status\" is set to \"Make a tentative reservation\", it is "
"received as a tentative reservation."
msgstr ""
"「予約ステータス」が「仮予約にする」の場合は、仮予約として受け付けます。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1994
msgid ""
"The cancellation deadline follows the \"Reservation cancellation\" setting."
msgstr "キャンセルの期限は「予約キャンセル」の設定に従います。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:2000
#: src/integrations/google-calendar/class-google-calendar-settings-panel.php:395
msgid "Customer phone number"
msgstr "お客様の電話番号"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:2004
msgid "Require a phone number"
msgstr "必須にする"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:2006
msgid ""
"When unchecked, customers can submit the user registration form, the profile "
"editing form, and the customer information fields for guest reservations "
"without entering a phone number."
msgstr ""
"チェックを外すと、新規登録・プロフィール編集・ゲスト予約のお客様情報欄で、電"
"話番号を入力しなくても送信できます。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:2009
msgid ""
"The phone number is used to contact customers when email does not reach them "
"and to match customer flags. Uncheck this for services that never contact "
"customers by phone, such as online seminars."
msgstr ""
"電話番号は、メールが届かないときの連絡先と、顧客フラグの照合に使います。オン"
"ラインセミナーなど電話で連絡しない業態ではチェックを外してください。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:2016
#: src/bookings/class-booking-admin.php:711
#: src/bookings/class-booking-admin.php:1636
#: src/bookings/class-booking-admin.php:1933
msgid "Reservation status"
msgstr "予約ステータス"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:2024
msgid "Instant confirmation"
msgstr "即時確定"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:2027
msgid "Make a tentative reservation"
msgstr "仮予約にする"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:2031
msgid ""
"With tentative reservations, reservations are received as \"Tentative\". "
"Change the status to \"Confirmed\" in the reservation list to confirm them."
msgstr ""
"仮予約にすると、予約は「仮予約」で届きます。予約一覧でステータスを「確定」に"
"変更すると確定になります。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:2032
msgid ""
"For tentative reservations, a reservation confirmation email will be sent to "
"the user even when the reservation is changed to confirmed."
msgstr ""
"仮予約の場合、確定に変更された時点でもユーザーに予約確定メールが送信されま"
"す。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:2033
msgid ""
"*Reservations made by users with administrator privileges and salon "
"privileges will be confirmed immediately."
msgstr ""
"※ 管理者権限及びサロン側の権限を持つユーザーによる予約の場合は即時確定になり"
"ます。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:2041
msgid "Guidance text for tentative reservation completion"
msgstr "仮予約完了時の案内文"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:2050
msgid ""
"This text is displayed below the heading \"Your tentative reservation has "
"been received.\" on the screen shown after a tentative reservation is "
"completed."
msgstr ""
"仮予約が完了した画面で、見出し「仮予約を受け付けました」の下に表示する文章で"
"す。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:2051
msgid ""
"You can rewrite it to match how your store operates, such as when you will "
"confirm the reservation (for example, \"We will contact you within 24 hours."
"\") and how you will contact the customer."
msgstr ""
"予約を確定するまでの目安（例: 24時間以内にご連絡します）や連絡方法など、お店"
"の運用に合わせて書き換えられます。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:2052
msgid "If left blank, the standard text below is displayed."
msgstr "空欄のときは、下記の標準の文章が表示されます。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:2053
msgid "HTML tags cannot be used, and line breaks are displayed as entered."
msgstr "HTML タグは使えません。改行は入力したとおりに表示されます。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:2054
msgid "The text of emails does not change."
msgstr "メールの文面は変わりません。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:2057
msgid "Standard text:"
msgstr "標準の文章:"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:2066
msgid "Reservation cancellation"
msgstr "予約キャンセル"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:2070
msgid "Cancellation of reservations via the web by users"
msgstr "ユーザーによるウェブからの予約キャンセル"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:2077
msgid "time specification"
msgstr "時間指定"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:2080
msgid "Cannot be canceled"
msgstr "キャンセル不可"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:2098
msgid "until the hour"
msgstr "時間前まで"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:2104
msgid "Duplicate reservations for the same staff"
msgstr "同一スタッフの予約重複"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:2114
msgid "Permitted only if specified from the management screen"
msgstr "管理画面からの指定の場合に限り許可"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:2117
msgid ""
"Duplicate reservations for the same staff member in the same time slot will "
"only be permitted if manually specified by the staff member from the "
"management screen."
msgstr ""
"同一スタッフの同じ時間帯での重複予約について、管理画面からスタッフによる手動"
"指定の場合に限って許可します。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:2123
