msgid ""
"The calendar URL is incorrect, or it is no longer valid on the booking site. "
"Copy the iCal calendar URL from the booking site again and enter it here."
msgstr ""
"カレンダーの URL が正しくないか、外部の予約サイトで無効になっています。外部の"
