#: src/resources/resource-labels.php:209
msgid ""
"For menus that allow %1$s selection, this is judged per selected %1$s, not "
"for the whole time slot."
msgstr ""
"%1$s指定を使うメニューでは、時間枠全体ではなく、指定された%1$sごとに判定しま"
"す。"

#. translators: %1$s: resource label (singular), e.g. "Room".
#: src/resources/resource-labels.php:211
